WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.387
Leonhard Euler

00:00:01.565 --> 00:00:02.354
the man who

00:00:02.166 --> 00:00:03.227
calculated in the

00:00:03.039 --> 00:00:03.699
dark

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.798
Abakcus's long read

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:06.376
on Euler

00:00:06.447 --> 00:00:07.225
who lost one

00:00:07.037 --> 00:00:08.050
