00:00:21.582 --> 00:00:22.643
who ever lived

00:00:22.809 --> 00:00:23.823
from the pastor's

00:00:23.634 --> 00:00:24.459
son meant for

00:00:24.271 --> 00:00:25.226
the pulpit to

00:00:25.038 --> 00:00:26.146
the blind years

00:00:25.957 --> 00:00:26.712
in St

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:28.232
Euler was born

00:00:28.044 --> 00:00:28.987
in Basel on

00:00:28.893 --> 00:00:31.192
15 April 1707

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:32.724
Full story on

00:00:32.535 --> 00:00:33.431
the dashboard
